From 029e053af368c753ce548ea9d0b98b08ecb3868e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Super Z <superz@z.ai>
Date: Sun, 7 Jun 2026 21:37:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: resolve 30 bugs and security issues

Critical (XSS):
- Escape HTML in tajweed coloring (tajweed.ts)
- Escape HTML in surah secrets display (mushaf.ts)
- Escape HTML in prayer name rendering (prayer.ts)

High:
- Fix memory leak: remove deviceorientation listener on compass hide (prayer.ts)
- Fix memory leak: track and allow stopping adhkar notification interval (adhkar.ts)
- Fix state mutation: use immutable object replacement for adhkar settings (adhkar.ts)
- Fix race condition: prevent double ayah advance in audio timeupdate (audio.ts)
- Add type validation for imported settings values (settings.ts)
- Fix division by zero in mushaf page layout with single line (mushaf-renderer.ts)

Medium:
- Fix languagechange event conflict: use custom app:langchange event (i18n.ts, app.ts)
- Fix duplicate event listeners in favorites export (favorites.ts)
- Fix null safety in search: check fullQuranText before filtering (search-core.ts)
- Replace native confirm() with custom modal for adhkar deletion (adhkar.ts)
- Add LRU cache limit (50 entries) for mushaf layout cache (mushaf-renderer.ts)
- Fix misleading getSleepTimerMinutes doc comment (audio.ts)
- Use i18n key for search history cleared message (search-core.ts + all translations)

All 353 tests passing. Build successful.
